# Environment variables consumed by the build. Copy to `.env` to use locally;
# CI sets these from `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` (NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL) and
# the repo's Actions secrets (UMAMI_SCRIPT_URL and UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID).
#
# The Umami script URL and website ID are stored as GitHub Actions secrets so
# they are not exposed in repository configuration or build logs. Umami's
# browser tracking protocol requires both values in the generated page HTML,
# so they cannot be hidden from site visitors and are not credentials.

# ---- Site URL -------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by nuxt-site-config / nuxt-og-image / RSS feed. The default comes from
# the `site` key in nuxt.config.ts; set this only to override it (e.g. a
# staging preview). Should match the live canonical URL in production.
NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://tech.weburz.com

# ---- Umami analytics ------------------------------------------------------
# Copy both values from the Umami dashboard tracking code. Leave either blank
# to disable analytics (the script tag is omitted when either is unset).
UMAMI_SCRIPT_URL=
UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=
